        <mxCell id="c113" value="&lt;i&gt;Time records end 20 days before the year-end. The first year has 2 fewer payroll postings charged to account 1090 than the last: 24 against 26. The first payroll of the first year posted to 5080.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="332" width="860" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
